  "notes": "USAGE: {全|すべ}て can function as a noun meaning \"everything\" or as an adverb/pre-noun adjectival meaning \"all.\"\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {全|すべ}ての + noun (all ~)\n- {全|すべ}てが (everything - subject)\n- {全|すべ}てを (everything - object)\n\nALTERNATIVE KANJI: Can also be written as {総|すべ}て, though {全|すべ}て is more common.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {全|すべ}て - all, everything (formal)\n- ⟦{皆|みな}→皆：01810_mina⟧/⟦{皆|みんな}→みんな：02972_minna⟧ - everyone (for people)\n- ⟦{全部|ぜんぶ}→全部：02888_zenbu⟧ - all, everything (casual)",
